---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout title="About | My Portfolio" page="about">

  <div class="page-wrapper">

   <!-- HERO -->
    <div class="proj-hero fade-in" style="min-height: 60vh;">
      <div class="proj-title">ABOUT ME</div>
    </div>
   
     <!-- om mig -->
    <div id="about-content" class="mb-16 lg:mb-24">
      <div class=" overflow-hidden shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)] fade-in">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-0 items-start">

<div class="order-1 relative overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3]">
            <img src="/Billeder/pb.webp" alt="Lærke Buch Nonved" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_25%] lg:object-contain lg:object-center" />
          </div>

          <div class="order-2 p-6 lg:p-8 flex flex-col justify-center bg-black/80 lg:rounded-r-2xl">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#ffffff] mb-4">Who am I?</h2>
            <div class="space-y-3 text-base text-gray-200 leading-relaxed mb-6">
              <p>I'm Lærke Buch Nonved — a Danish student studying Visual Communication with a specialisation in Coded Design at DMJX, working at the intersection of design, code, and visual storytelling.</p>
              <p>I'm happiest when projects feel alive and human — something you can actually sense. Technically, I work with a range of tools, including JavaScript, P5.js, Three.js, Unity, and Astro, but what really drives me is the experimental approach: combining creativity with code and seeing what emerges.</p>
              <p>Alongside my studies, I work in a nursery, which has given me a strong sense of the human side of things — collaboration, responsibility, and meeting people where they are. I also have experience in festival coordination and voluntary project management, including helping organise the Mediepuls festival at DMJX.</p>
              <p>Whether it's digital media, illustration, or physical experiences, I'm always trying to make something that means something.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

<footer style="margin-top: 4rem; text-align: center;">
  <p style="color: #ffffff;">© Lærke Buch Nonved portfolio</p>
</footer>

  </div>

</Layout>